Obviously there is a problem loading the 'Cairo' package.  I wrote the
code so it should only load Cairo if it is available and otherwise
retreat to other PNG device options.  However, since Cairo is faster
that the others, make sure to install the Cairo package; it is useful.

I've seen the "match(x, table, nomatch = 0)" error occationally before
and I think they are unrelated to aroma.affymetrix and rather due to
some weird interaction of S4/S3 but that is just a guess.

